.landing-page
  .landing-intro
    %h1 Welcome to CouncilVoteTracker.ie
    %hr
    %p
      CouncilVoteTracker.ie tracks and publishes roll-call votes at monthly council meetings,
      so you can see how your councillors voted on issues you care about.
    %p
      Keep in mind that the majority of council votes – at committee, and at the monthly
      meetings – are taken by voice, and so we're not able to track how each councillor
      voted and record that here.
    %hr

  .landing-councils
    .councils-grid
      - @councils.each do |council|
        = link_to "/#{council.slug}", class: 'council-btn' do
          = council.name

  .landing-contact
    %p
      If you'd like to add another council to this website, and maintain that section
      yourself, adding votes as they happen, please get in touch.
      = mail_to 'sam@dublininquirer.com', 'sam@dublininquirer.com'
